as of rn this file uses 3D models with settings:
Forward: Z Forward
Up: -Y Up
Geometry: Triangulate Faces, Write Normals, Include UVs


notes:
GlobalUbo and FrameInfo is defined in vke_frame_info.VK_NULL_HANDLE
Each push constant is defined in the systems cpp file (point_light_system, simple_render_system)

The lights are translucent billboards. 

camera position is obtained through inverseView 3rd column

Order of inheritence:
Window.h, device.h, buffer.h, model.h, game_object.h, swapchain.h, renderer.h, descriptor.h, camera.h, frameinfo.h, pipeline.h, 
shaders, rendersystems, keyboard_movement_controller.h, first_app.h

When creating a new object that uses binding in shaders, a new binding should be made in first_app.cpp in globalSetLayout

